(footprint "DIN41612_M_3x8+8_Female_Vertical_THT_Power"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "kicad-footprint-generator")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "DIN41612 type M vertical female, 24 signal + 8 plated power pads P1-P8 (ERNI 294711-E, plated hole 3.1mm). From ERNI Cat E004045 drilling plan. NOTE: the housing ships with the 24 signal contacts loaded and the 8 power positions as EMPTY CAVITIES - the power contacts are a SEPARATE line item. WARNING: there is NO 10A female PCB-solder contact in this family - the 10A/20A females are wire-terminated only (594172-E solder cup 16AWG, 594178-E crimp 16AWG), and the only board-terminated females are 40A PRESS-FIT (044965-E / 044639-E), which do not suit these solder-drilled 3.1mm holes. So the P1-P8 pads here are wire anchor points, not contact tails: terminate the power bus in wire. Contact class must match the card-side male (594170-E 10A PCB solder -> 594172-E/594178-E 10A female).")
	(tags "DIN 41612 IEC 60603 M")
